\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {C.1}{\ignorespaces Supplementary WRN-28-10 architecture check on CIFAR-10. Values are from a single run and are therefore not included in the main paired claims. Mean(8) and Worst(8) are computed over the eight non-AutoAttack attacks; AutoAttack-$\ell _\infty $ is reported separately.}}{113}{figure.caption.92}%
